WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.740
<v The First AD>Book twelve. The Sirens. Rowers, stroke.

2
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.350
<v The Director>Action.

3
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.390
<v The Director>They look like a loop.

4
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.680
<v The Cinematographer>One clock. A stroke every two point six seconds.

5
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.710
<v A Rower>I'm four hundredths of a stroke late.

6
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.680
<v Another Rower>Three hundredths of a stroke early.

7
00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.010
<v The Helmsman>I don't row. I steer.

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.000
<v A Siren>We sing on a clock of our own.

9
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.050
<v The Director>Print it.

10
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.600
<v A Rower>What?

11
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.690
<v The First AD>Wax in their ears. It's in the scene.

12
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.260
<v The First AD>I'll check on all of you at the top of the hour.

13
00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:44.510
<v The First AD>Book five, on the same boat. Calypso, your trees. Odysseus, beside her.

14
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.120
<v The Director>Action.

15
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.200
<v Calypso>Here at the island's edge the tall trees stand: alder, and poplar, and sky-high fir.

16
00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.030
<v The Director>Where is Calypso?

17
00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.340
<v The Cinematographer>Behind the back of his head.

18
00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:02.430
<v Odysseus>I'm the lead.

19
00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.330
<v The Cinematographer>Take one. Twenty-four seconds of her lines, behind his head.

20
00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:16.180
<v Calypso>Seven years I kept him. One take, and he's in front of me.

21
00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.270
<v The Director>Apart.

22
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.120
<v The First AD>He means: a man's height apart.

23
00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:29.300
<v Calypso>Here at the island's edge the tall trees stand: alder, and poplar, and sky-high fir.

24
00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:34.070
<v The Cinematographer>Her face. And the bow on his back is still across the frame.

25
00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.140
<v The Director>Keep it.

26
00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:38.930
<v Odysseus>Do I still get the raft?

27
00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.800
<v Calypso>Four days. You build it yourself.

28
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.710
<v The First AD>That's a wrap on the sea.

29
00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:47.000
<v The Helmsman>I'll steer us home.
